WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Start here. Twenty minutes from the download to the first message kept.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Three steps, and MindToo shows you which one you are on.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.200
Connect one assistant first; everything else can wait.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:17.400
Send it one message.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.000
Every message you send and every reply you get, kept as it happens, in each connected assistant.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.600
Help holds the whole manual inside MindToo, with or without a connection: press F1 from any screen.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
MindToo. Start here. privateai.ltd/mindtoo/manual/start/

